                'body_en' => 'Look beyond likes and follower counts. Track reach, saves, shares, useful comments, website clicks, qualified inquiries, or conversions according to your goal. Record which topics and formats work, then test one change at a time. Do not treat a small sample or short-term result as a guaranteed rule.',
